// Decodes real Oxford Nanopore MinION reads and scores them against the
// strands Twist synthesized: the 50-cluster sample of Microsoft's Clustered
// Nanopore Reads dataset that ships with the tests. `nucle reads` reports
// the same numbers for the same files.
//
// `blind` also throws the dataset's cluster labels away and decodes from
// the reads alone; the run stops if that recovers 90% of the strands or
// fewer.
decode reads "../../nucle_ecc/tests/fixtures/cnr/Clusters.txt" against "../../nucle_ecc/tests/fixtures/cnr/Centers.txt" {
    blind,
    expect recovery > 90%
}
